        {
          "text": "’Ba Kiriati-yearimua ’diyi emu ra, yi ’du sanduku Yehovani ra, ji eri Abinadabu vile joa oni dria uru; azini yi ’ba mva erini Eleazari alaru sanduku Yehovani ma ta mbazu’i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eri nga eca ’dini, ewu sandukuni adriria Kirati-yearimua engazu o’du erini ecazuria, ovu ewu izuru, eri ovu eli kali iri, ’ba Israelini dria wu Yehova vu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
